  "text_md": "Any time of day, wherever you are, there’s always a great reason to choose Hormel Foods. You provide the hunger, we’ll deliver the great ﬂavor and convenience that keeps you moving throughout the day.\n\n# taking time out for taste\n\nMemorable homemade sandwiches start with a visit to our Di Lusso Deli Company counter. This premium line of deli meats, cheeses, and condiments can be found in the deli case in select markets. Hormel pepperoni is another great choice for snacks that deliver taste and satisfaction. Our Di Lusso and other lines of pre-sliced meats generated double-digit sales gains in fiscal 2004.\n\n# tempting mid-day meals\n\nCasual lunchtime dining is a tasty mid-day booster with our Austin Blues BBQ and sandwiches made from Hormel Foods’ Bread Ready line of pre-sliced luncheon meats. With nearly half of the average family food dollar spent away from home, Hormel Foods has worked to become a preferred supplier of preportioned, pre-sliced, and pre-flavored items that build repeat Foodservice business. Foodservice sales were up 22 percent in fiscal 2004.\n\nHRONA\n\n![](<4219481cdf0ac108ce2139105053a1bf72eab47c7c57a418bf92496551afe1f6_images/imageFile1.png>)\n\nPPERUN\n\nDiced\n\nHorme)\n\nGon\n\nlormel\n\nPERONI\n\n(Bite\n\n1\n\nDrr\n\n# getting a good start\n\nHormel Foods breakfast meats are great eye-openers, whether it’s Hormel Canadian bacon, Hormel microwave bacon, Hormel fully cooked bacon, or the increasingly popular Jennie-O Turkey Store turkey bacon products. The popularity of Hormel microwave and fully cooked bacon grew again in fiscal 2004, with sales up 19 percent.\n\n![](<4219481cdf0ac108ce2139105053a1bf72eab47c7c57a418bf92496551afe1f6_images/imageFile4.png>)\n\nBacon\n\nHormel\n\nRcady\n\nHormel\n\n![](<4219481cdf0ac108ce2139105053a1bf72eab47c7c57a418bf92496551afe1f6_images/imageFile2.png>)\n\n![](<4219481cdf0ac108ce2139105053a1bf72eab47c7c57a418bf92496551afe1f6_images/imageFile3.png>)\n\nBlack\n\nLabel\n\n![](<4219481cdf0ac108ce2139105053a1bf72eab47c7c57a418bf92496551afe1f6_images/imageFile5.png>)\n\nBREAD\n\nREADY\n\n![](<4219481cdf0ac108ce2139105053a1bf72eab47c7c57a418bf92496551afe1f6_images/imageFile6.png>)\n\n",
